<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Discussion on design of activation function for scaling factor</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We define our custom activation function, <em id="A2.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">linear clipping</em>, as follows:</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F11" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2602.23057v1/sigmoid_vs_linear_clipping.svg" id="A2.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:238/134;" width="238" height="134"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>: </span><span id="A2.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison of a sigmoid and a custom clipping-linear function.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
